# =====================================================================
# | Parameters for Gaspar et al. (1990)'s TKE vertical mixing scheme  |
# =====================================================================
#
# ADDED: pkg/ggl90 is compiled in (packages.conf) and
# useGGL90=.TRUE. (data.pkg), but this repo had no data.ggl90 -- a
# genuine gap, not a deliberate omission: ggl90_readparms.F opens
# 'data.ggl90' with STATUS='OLD' unconditionally whenever the package is
# compiled in, regardless of whether its own computed diffusivity ends
# up used, so its absence would be a fatal file-not-found at runtime.
#
# Fetched verbatim from ECCO-GROUP/ECCO-v4-Configurations's own
# "ECCOv4 Release 6"/namelist/data.ggl90 -- the same source
# already used for delR/tRef/sRef in input_darwin_offline/data,
# rather than invented. Note this offline run's own GGL90diffKrFile
# (data.off) overwrites GGL90diffKr from the converted V4r6 archive every
# timestep (see code_offline_ggl90/offline_get_diffus.F), the same
# pattern Steph's original setup used for KPP -- so these TKE-scheme
# parameters govern pkg/ggl90's own online calculation, which is
# superseded by that offline-loaded value; they are needed for
# ggl90_readparms.F to succeed, not because the online TKE scheme
# actually determines the mixing used here.
 &GGL90_PARM01
# GGL90taveFreq = 345600000.,
# GGL90dumpFreq = 86400.,
# GGL90writeState=.FALSE.,
# GGL90diffTKEh=3.e3,
 GGL90alpha=30.,
# GGL90TKEFile = 'TKE_init.bin',
 GGL90TKEmin  = 1.e-7,
 GGL90TKEbottom = 1.e-6,
 mxlMaxFlag =2,
 mxlSurfFlag=.TRUE.,
 /
